  "schema_version": 1,
  "note": "Fixed landscape layouts. The dark members share the field, the top bleed glow, the mosaic field, a centred logo and title stack, a centred UI slot, and the grain layer. Only the colours and the boxes change. The light member swaps the glow for two pastel blooms and trades the UI slot for a bottom art band.",
